  <item>
    <title>006 谈谈妇科病：痛经，多囊卵巢综合征和子宫肌瘤</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/647da33d5ed4bd1a461dc438</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">647da33d5ed4bd1a461dc438</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Jun 2023 08:56:29 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>年纪轻轻就一把年纪的我们，围绕妇科病展开了一次“病友互助会”。从月经、多囊聊到子宫肌瘤，基于我们自身的妇检体验和相关文献资料，和大家来聊聊常见的妇科问题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>子宫里的潮汐，反复拍打着女性的人生海岸。请多加注意子宫给你的信号，拒绝羞耻、勇敢出击！让我们一起做健康的强壮女性！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>这期节目不作为任何医学建议。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="90">01:30</a> &nbsp;抛弃性羞耻，妇科病并不可怕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> &nbsp;我们的妇检体验：女权最渴望已婚身份的时刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> &nbsp;妇科问诊前的准备 &amp; 妇科检查的流程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a> &nbsp;女孩，你可以不用忍受痛经</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1035">17:15</a> &nbsp;多囊女孩是被上天选中要好好生活的人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> &nbsp;多囊的病症表现和可能的患病原因</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1252">20:52</a> &nbsp;如何判定是多囊卵巢综合征：《多囊卵巢综合征中国诊疗指南》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://m.haodf.com/neirong/wenzhang/5806481767.html" href="https://m.haodf.com/neirong/wenzhang/5806481767.html">m.haodf.com</a></span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1489">24:49</a> &nbsp;喵喵的多囊看病体验：生殖科不可以报销医保！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1546">25:46</a> &nbsp;治疗多囊的短效避孕药：让我们又爱又怕的达英35</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1748">29:08</a> &nbsp;生活方式干预是治疗多囊的首选：饮食，运动，行为干预</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1806">30:06</a> &nbsp;关于多囊的食疗指南</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2136">35:36</a> &nbsp;可靠的营养补充剂们：维生素D，肌醇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2300">38:20</a> &nbsp;多囊的运动建议：减脂和增肌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2347">39:07</a> &nbsp;多囊的行为干预：早睡！解压！尽可能避免工业污染！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2443">40:43</a> &nbsp;神出鬼没的子宫肌瘤</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2615">43:35</a> &nbsp;子宫肌瘤的诊断方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2694">44:54</a> &nbsp;子宫肌瘤的常见药物治疗：孕三烯酮</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2744">45:44</a> &nbsp;希望永远也用不到的子宫肌瘤手术方案</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2959">49:19</a> &nbsp;良性但不善良的子宫肌瘤</span></p><span></span><p><span>好好生活指南：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiXB-Wlf4oux5T7XjnbSF50c-uXK.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiWxMxc02jbHtJeZTjjbV5LXInW4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>小🍠：@后有来者-旺旺 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;@后有来者-喵喵</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考文献：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《多囊卵巢综合征中国诊疗指南》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《多囊卵巢综合征完全指南》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《8 Steps to Reverse Your PCOS》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《身体由我：关于了不起的女性身体的一切 》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《专家诊治子宫肌瘤》</span></p><span></span><p><span>背景音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>夏日蒸汽波 - COAST MUSIC</span></p><span></span><p><span>キリマンジャロだね - 川田瑠夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>ぽっぴんジャンプ♪ ~Solo Piano Ver - 川田瑠夏</span></p><span></span><p><span>New Soul - Yael Naim</span></p>]]></description>
