  <item>
    <title>002 学会对陌生人说谎：人生如戏，演好自己</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/633c321c9186d4e4c46a0a66</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">633c321c9186d4e4c46a0a66</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Oct 2022 13:16:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>现代社会，社交冗杂。面对陌生人的搭话、应付繁杂的社会关系，我们要如何保护好自己的隐私信息，节省不必要的社交能量？</span></p><span></span><p><span>人生如戏，学会在“真我”与“假我”之间自如切换是重要一课。戴上你的面具，加入我们的假面人生吧！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="73">01:13</a> 何为“人设”？意欲何为？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="270">04:30</a> 特邀来信：朋友们如何对陌生人说谎？</span></p><span></span><p><span>尼古拉斯：用冷漠人设来树立自我保护机制</span></p><span></span><p><span>好门：敷衍回答来回避追问</span></p><span></span><p><span>miya：接纳与陌生人交流，获取信息与体验</span></p><span></span><p><span>盼盼：树立防备，明确无义务对陌生人和盘托出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1173">19:33</a> 实用小技巧分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1408">23:28</a> 思想的解放是第一步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 特邀来信：如何利用人设职场求生？</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱新觉罗：懵懂无知，柔弱无辜人设</span></p><span></span><p><span>叶赫那拉：反复提问，树立不好惹人设</span></p><span></span><p><span>尼古拉斯：善于倾听人设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2123">35:23</a> 实用 小人设分享</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2541">42:21</a> 树立边界感，利用人设保护自己</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>参考文献：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>欧文·戈夫曼《日常生活中的自我呈现》</span></p><span></span><p><span>唐纳德·温尼科特《成熟过程与促进环境：情感发展理论研究》</span></p><span></span><p><span>徐香玉《新媒体视域下“人设”现象的文化研究》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>背景音乐：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>夏日蒸汽波- COAST MUSIC</span></p><span></span><p><span>Loving Strangers - Jocelyn Pook &amp; Russian Red</span></p><span></span><p><span>週末京都現実逃避 - しゃろう</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvyFw0k1h5973z1q4lZIxX2Xuzn9.m4a" length="64506235" type="audio/mp4"/>
